<p>In a recent interview, James Dean Bradfield stated that before his neighbour moved into a care home, he was gifted their beloved upright piano. The 100-year-old instrument sat in the Bradfield household with the rest of the family throughout the lockdown, effectively reshaping the musician’s approach to composition.</p>

